.Pp
A machine cloned from it carries the change and its own name:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# kvm-clone kg-3253849 kg-3253849-c2 --snap golden
\&...
# (then, inside kg-3253849-c2)
# hostname; cat /etc/kg-proof
kg-3253849-c2
built by kvm-golden
.Ed
.Ss A machine from a golden, with a script (--post, --keep, --ram, --cpus)
The script:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
#!/bin/bash
set -e
dnf -q -y install tree >/dev/null 2>&1 || apt-get -qq install -y tree
tree --version
.Ed
.Pp
The base is the golden made above:
