.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It "kvm-golden: no base VM 'klab-golden-DISTRO' (klab golden DISTRO builds it)"
The lab golden for that distribution has not been built on this host.
.It "kvm-golden: 'NAME' already exists"
A machine or a volume has that name.
.It "kvm-golden: NAME got no address in 4 minutes"
The guest did not come up on the network.
Its console,
.Ql virsh console NAME ,
shows why.
.It "kvm-golden: root ssh to ADDRESS never answered"
The guest has an address but root cannot log in with the key; usually a
base that was not made to accept it.
.It "kvm-golden: the post-install failed; NAME is left running at ADDRESS to look at"
.It "kvm-golden: the --run command failed; NAME is left running at ADDRESS to look at"
The script's own output is above.
.It "kvm-golden: NAME did not shut down in 3 minutes"
The guest ignored the shutdown request; it has not been sealed.
.It "kvm-golden: the seal failed; NAME is shut off and NOT a golden"
.Xr kldload-seal 8
says why above; a disk with no partition cannot be sealed.
.It "kvm-golden: kvm-clone failed; it removed what it had made"
.El
